## Reference project layout (rename per project — see fingerprint rule)

```
app/src/main/java/<pkg>/
├── startup/
│   ├── AppEntry.kt          Application: Firebase + AppCheck + AppsFlyer init
│   └── WelcomePortal.kt     LAUNCHER: gray/white routing + branded splash
├── portal/
│   ├── StreamPortal.kt      Full-screen WebView shell (gray)
│   ├── KeyboardPan.kt       Slides the WebView clear of the keyboard
│   ├── AlertPortal.kt       Push-permission promo (Accept / Skip)
│   └── OfflinePortal.kt     No-internet screen + Retry
├── reach/
│   ├── ReachDispatch.kt     POST to config endpoint (OkHttp)
│   └── TrackingDispatch.kt  AppsFlyer: prime/ignite, deep link, GCD, re-ask
├── signal/
│   ├── PushRelay.kt         FirebaseMessagingService
│   └── PushBus.kt           process-wide warm-URL hand-off (callback + queue)
├── vault/
│   ├── CipherVault.kt       XOR deobfuscator (unique seed per project)
│   └── DataVault.kt         SharedPreferences + EncryptedSharedPreferences
├── wire/
│   └── NetWire.kt           connectivity (default network callback + TCP probe)
├── blueprint/
│   ├── AppBlueprint.kt      central config: bundle, timeouts, encoded strings
│   ├── RunChannel.kt        enum STREAM / NATIVE / UNDECIDED
│   └── ChannelResult.kt     config response model
└── <game>/...               native game (white part) — do not entangle with gray

app/src/main/res/
├── drawable/ic_notif_<x>.xml        monochrome notification icon (NOT launcher)
├── drawable-nodpi/*.webp            gray screen backgrounds (WebP, orientation-aware)
└── xml/network_security_config.xml  cleartextTrafficPermitted=true

app/google-services.json             Firebase config (release package only)
keystore/keystore.properties         signing creds (gitignored)
```

