## App requirements (per TZ)

| Requirement | Value |
|---|---|
| Android target / min SDK | 35 / 30 (use lowest the stores + SDKs allow) |
| App size | < 100 MB (use WebP for screen art, not multi-MB PNG) |
| Loading screen | animated indicator, adapts portrait + landscape, <10s |
| Push promo screen | adapts portrait + landscape |
| Adaptive icon | fills the shape, no borders, no clipping |
| Notification icon | separate monochrome icon (Android) |
| WebView | Safe Area in any orientation + after lock/unlock |
| Rotation | allow system rotation / sensor auto-rotate |
| Back | WebView goes back; back on first page does NOT close app |
| ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS | keep loading the last main-frame URL, retry up to 6 |
| Redirect hops | invisible to the user — a cover, never a second splash |
| JS / cookies / sessions | enabled |
| inline autoplay video | `mediaPlaybackRequiresUserGesture = false` |
| file upload | WebChromeClient file chooser, no extra perms |
| keyboard | must not cover focused input |
| Privacy policy | reachable per store rules |

